WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
AI agents can act. One wrong command can change production.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:08.200
GuardRail checks high-risk actions before execution
and blocks anything that violates your policies.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.900
The control layer runs locally, makes deterministic decisions,
and leaves a readable audit trail.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:18.900
Eleven real bypasses were found and closed.
One hundred and six automated checks pass on Ubuntu and macOS.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.700
Give agents power. Keep control.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.400
The website is guardrail.promptandbuild.de.
